# Frozen evidence keeps its original bytes. The copied text files are CRLF and hashed as CRLF, the
# log and canonical-text streams are deterministic gzip archives, and the manifest binds every file
# by sha256, so git must not normalise any of them on checkout. index.md and this file are LF.
*.txt binary
*.json binary
*.py binary
*.log binary
*.gz binary
*.bat binary
*.bin binary
index.md text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
